{
  "scope": "Mathematical proof-route audit, separate from the manuscript; compiler and kernel verification are recorded independently.",
  "status": "Source proof routes reviewed; library build (13,134 jobs) and all 11,195 unchanged full public type/axiom checks passed.",
  "specific_alignment": [
    "Integer coordinates use the checked Smith basis construction.",
    "Euler witnesses use original-language cylindrical cell trees.",
    "The relative Gamma calculation follows unary endpoint preparation and induction on those trees.",
    "Complete witness graphs are fixed before VF preparation.",
    "Geometric denominator clearing never cancels the affine class before localization.",
    "Variety fibres range over every ambient point in the exact generated parameter base.",
    "Mixed-degree representatives are presented with labels in RV_infinity^k; each exact stratum is normalized in its own degree.",
    "Geometric mixed-degree Fubini thickens each vanishing label by the affine padding object before compactness and reduces to the single-degree fixed witness.",
    "Inflated-family representatives are chosen over the ground with the Gamma parameter adjoined, promoted to Gamma families and uniformized by compactness.",
    "Relative charts use the saturated left kernel, divisibility of residue units and extension of right-invertible rows; the value set is the value image of the piece.",
    "The base partition uses Gamma fibre integration and coordinate-order independence, not a polyhedral decomposition.",
    "The torus class is sent to [A^1]-1 by the comparison; the factor g^n is retained."
  ],
